<title>UK: Merrill Lynch adds $175 million to five-year bond. [CORRECTED 08:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch adds $175 million to five-year bond. [CORRECTED 08:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to $500 million from $325 million (corrects from $300 mln and $125 mln respectively), lead manager</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT ** $300 MLN	COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    02.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.63    PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.055   SPREAD	+38 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
